{"page":{"id":"addf4f38-e054-4313-bb56-09f7eae2313a","theme":"elder-scrolls","slug":"/elder-scrolls","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/elder-scrolls","title":"The Elder Scrolls","meta_title":"The Elder Scrolls (The Elder Scrolls) — topic, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Elder Scrolls is Bethesda Softworks' open-world fantasy franchise spanning Nirn and Tamriel, from Arena and Daggerfall through Morrowind, Oblivion, and…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/bethesda-softworks\" class=\"entity-link\">Bethesda Softworks</a>&#039; fantasy RPG series set on <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel\" class=\"entity-link\">Tamriel</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/bethesda-softworks\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Bethesda Softworks</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-v-skyrim\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iii-morrowind\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Elder Scrolls III: Morrowind</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iv-oblivion\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Nirn</strong></a> and <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/daedra\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Daedra</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How The Elder Scrolls connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Created By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/bethesda-softworks\" class=\"entity-link\">Bethesda Softworks</a>\n            — <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/bethesda-softworks\" class=\"entity-link\">Bethesda Softworks</a> publishes The Elder Scrolls.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-v-skyrim\" class=\"entity-link\">The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim</a>\n            — <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/skyrim\" class=\"entity-link\">Skyrim</a> is a mainline Elder Scrolls game.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iii-morrowind\" class=\"entity-link\">The Elder Scrolls III: Morrowind</a>\n            — <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/morrowind\" class=\"entity-link\">Morrowind</a> is a mainline Elder Scrolls game.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iv-oblivion\" class=\"entity-link\">The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion</a>\n            — Oblivion is a mainline Elder Scrolls game.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn\" class=\"entity-link\">Nirn</a>\n            — <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn\" class=\"entity-link\">Nirn</a> is the mortal world of the series.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/daedra\" class=\"entity-link\">Daedra</a>\n            — <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/daedra\" class=\"entity-link\">Daedra</a> are central to Elder Scrolls cosmology.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/morrowind/vvardenfell\" class=\"entity-link\">Vvardenfell</a>\n            — <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/morrowind/vvardenfell\" class=\"entity-link\">Vvardenfell</a> is connected to The Elder Scrolls through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/skyrim\" class=\"entity-link\">Skyrim</a>\n            — The Elder Scrolls is connected to <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/skyrim\" class=\"entity-link\">Skyrim</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Contains</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">5</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-v-skyrim\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Contains\"\n                >\n                    <strong>The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim</strong>\n                    <span>2011 RPG of dragons and civil war.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iii-morrowind\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Contains\"\n                >\n                    <strong>The Elder Scrolls III: Morrowind</strong>\n                    <span>2002 RPG set on Vvardenfell.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iv-oblivion\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Contains\"\n                >\n                    <strong>The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion</strong>\n                    <span>2006 RPG of the Oblivion Crisis.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n    